    "detailed_description": "Robots have drawn humanity into war, and it's your job as Blaser Man and Turtle Belly Bot to infiltrate and wipe out the heart of these tin puppets!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience 10 varied levels based on classic games in Sidekick! But not only that, in Sidekick different genres are linked thematically. It doesn't matter whether it's run and gun, top-down shooter, or jet ski action, here you can find everything that made you happy and frustrated on the NES!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd of course, there is also a multiplayer mode, and it's 100% couch co-op! You and your friends! In real life, together! Shoot, I tell you, shoot!",
    "about_the_game": "Robots have drawn humanity into war, and it's your job as Blaser Man and Turtle Belly Bot to infiltrate and wipe out the heart of these tin puppets!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience 10 varied levels based on classic games in Sidekick! But not only that, in Sidekick different genres are linked thematically. It doesn't matter whether it's run and gun, top-down shooter, or jet ski action, here you can find everything that made you happy and frustrated on the NES!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAnd of course, there is also a multiplayer mode, and it's 100% couch co-op! You and your friends! In real life, together! Shoot, I tell you, shoot!",
